abstract: >-
  Research software and OWL/SHACL ontology for interpreting ionospheric echoes.
  The repository contains routines for reading Digisonde ionograms, synthesizing
  oblique traces, training segmentation networks with physical constraints and
  checking the consistency of predicted modes. It includes ontology test scenes;
  the full sounding corpus and trained network weights are not bundled.
keywords:
  - ionogram
  - oblique sounding
  - ontology
  - semantic segmentation
  - SHACL
